sequenceDiagram
    title Dual-Role Pairing Correlation: One App Confirms on Both Nodes

    participant App as App
    participant PeripheralNode as Peripheral Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    participant CentralNode as Central Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, CentralNode: Precondition: both Nodes configured, link established (state = connected on both).

    App->>CentralNode: GapCentral.PairAndBond()

    rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
        Note over PeripheralNode, CentralNode: SMP starts (LESC with MITM)
        CentralNode-)PeripheralNode: Pairing_Request
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Pairing_Response
        CentralNode-)PeripheralNode: Pairing_Public_Key
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Pairing_Public_Key
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Pairing_Confirm
        CentralNode-)PeripheralNode: Pairing_Random
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Pairing_Random
    end

    CentralNode-->>App: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)
    PeripheralNode-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)

    Note over App: Same passkey on both sides.<br>App must confirm on BOTH services.

    App->>CentralNode: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
    App->>PeripheralNode: GapPeripheral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)

    rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
        Note over PeripheralNode, CentralNode: SMP completes and link is encrypted
        CentralNode-)PeripheralNode: Pairing_DHKey_Check
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Pairing_DHKey_Check
        CentralNode-)PeripheralNode: LL_ENC_REQ
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: LL_ENC_RSP
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: LL_START_ENC_REQ (encrypted)
        CentralNode-)PeripheralNode: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Identity_Information (IRK)
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Identity_Address_Information
        PeripheralNode-)CentralNode: Signing_Information (CSRK)
    end

    CentralNode-->>App: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
    CentralNode-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
    PeripheralNode-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
    PeripheralNode-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
